<title>UK: Ellis &amp; Everard H1 pretax profit up 20 pct.</title>
<headline>Ellis &amp; Everard H1 pretax profit up 20 pct.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to Oct 31, 1996.</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Dividend		   3.3p		   vs 3.0p</p>
<p> Pretax profit	    15.6		   vs 13.0</p>
<p> Earnings per share     11.8p		  vs 10.4p</p>
<p> Turnover		   321.8		  vs 292.6</p>
<p>NOTE - Full company name is Ellis &amp; Everard Plc, a chemicals and polymers distributor.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 4017</p>
